language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

contract BuckingContract.
interface BuckingInterface.
message-set BuckingRequests.
message-set BuckingResponses.

BuckingInterface follows BuckingContract.
BuckingContract allows BuckingRequests.
BuckingContract specifies "Independent subscriber streams; correlated results, durable production/activation and supersedable profile/planning distinguished. Existing ProductionEvent alone does not carry complete cut provenance.".
BuckingContract status inherited.
BuckingContract allows BuckingResponses.
BuckingContract schema "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/contracts/proto/mvp1/bucking/v1/bucking.proto".
BuckingRequests member "mvp1.bucking.v1.BuckingClientMessage".
BuckingResponses member "mvp1.bucking.v1.BuckingServerMessage".
